title: why
pid: 3881085f-f215-4c9d-ab49-dec741a60b26
body: |2-
  Creating a headline through Skg's commands prompts for any skgrepo it
  cannot inherit: a headline inherits one from the nearest occurrence
  above it, passing through folders, ghosts, tombstones, unknown
  viewnodes and restricted viewnodes, so a root prompts, and so does a headline whose
  walk up meets an alias, an ID, a flag or a change viewnode first, or
  meets no occurrence.  Save
  validation also catches a node whose skgrepo was omitted when the
  headline was entered as plain text.
